WEBVTT

00:12:29.239 --> 00:12:31.353
on all three sides.

00:12:31.353 --> 00:12:33.737
I really love this park.

00:12:33.737 --> 00:12:35.962
You know, railings have to be higher now,

00:12:35.962 --> 00:12:38.506
so we put bar seating at the edge,

00:12:38.506 --> 00:12:40.618
and you can get so close to the water

00:12:40.618 --> 00:12:42.346
you're practically on it.

00:12:42.346 --> 00:12:44.215
And see how the railing widens

00:12:44.215 --> 00:12:45.631
and flattens out so you can lay down

00:12:45.631 --> 00:12:47.513
your lunch or your laptop.

00:12:47.513 --> 00:12:49.493
And I love when people come there

00:12:49.493 --> 00:12:51.353
and look up and they say,

00:12:51.353 --> 00:12:55.380
"Wow, there's Brooklyn, and it's so close."

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:57.732
So what's the trick?

00:12:57.732 --> 00:12:59.541
How do you turn a park

00:12:59.541 --> 00:13:02.707
into a place that people want to be?